  "pages": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18660.png",
      "text": "Enoa ke Katse. Enoa ke Ntja.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d9f0788497e94b6b4bc7f37c77b86bba845160cd33e4b3bbecbe02accabca58c"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18661.png",
      "text": "Katse le Ntja ba batla ho toroea. Katse le Ntja ba batla ho tlotsa ka mebala. Katse le Ntja ba batla ho etsa sets'oants'o. Ntja oa qala. O nka pents'ele le pampiri. Pampiri e likhutlo li 'ne.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:97cd87b0b397b50ce0d9ab8fa092c88709522dd42fae0bf1c89e2b6e39ecc104"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18662.png",
      "text": "Pele Ntja o toroea sebopeho sa lehe. Sebopeho sa lehe ke 'mele oa Katse. Helee, ho bonolo!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6335106e02c51975e3556bd43d2c6d2ecd8af35ffe5b04e5b0f511846e0c22f9"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18663.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea likhutlotharo tse peli holima sebopeho sa lehe leo. Likhutlotharo tse peli tseo ke litsebe tsa Katse, o toroea le khutlotharo e nts'o kahara sebopeho sa lehe. Khutlotharo e nts'o ke nko ea Katse 'me o toroea mola holima nko.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f778722272f8fcace72093b2a89250737dabc67394f08bfc093906801ff4e62b"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18664.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea mahlo le lints'i tsa Katse. Mahlo ke matheba a mabeli. Lints'i ke mela e 'meli. Helee, ho bonolo!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d11773aa1f92301b2847d4ed1cbca72eccf97b530d7ab39022d3a83101f7b151"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18665.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea molomo oa Katse. Molomo ke mola. O shebahala joalo ka tlhaku ea 'w', hape o toroea litelu tsa Katse. Litelu tse tharo ka lehlakoreng le lets'ehali, le tse tharo ka lehlakoreng le letona.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b87ad594532a949a35d6a987edea7340d0d847b5022f55710f631421b08a7ad5"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18666.png",
      "text": "Sets'oants'o se sentse se tla fela. O toroea matsoho le maoto a Katse. Matsoho le maoto ke mela, hape o toroea monoana oa leoto oa Katse. Menoana ea maoto e sebilikoe, o toroea le mohatla oa Katse. Mohatla ke mola o molelele.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:fbd428c719db8fc3c14b5f56ca852bfcc4cde3a63c26582d87249fe1142e57f2"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18667.png",
      "text": "Qetellong o toroea mela 'meleng oa Katse, ebe o o kenya 'mala oa lamunu. Sets'oants'o se felile. Helee, se setle!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a344dd2d8db8835f9324a4048df5bea242899059b2ea4afaabbd029806c97ee3"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18668.png",
      "text": "Joale e se e le nako ea Katse. O nka pents'ele o nka le pampiri. Pampiri ke khutlonne.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b2ea13ee45cb6348c58f8042e8d4ebefa056b8bc121aff76762fb26c59dc5c94"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18669.png",
      "text": "Pele Katse o toroea sebopeho sa lehe. Sebopeho sa lehe ke 'mele oa Ntja. Helee, se setle!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ed94fa3f135a6448eaa5032d0ee50cac3e83300926995b9b47b1050d59e07f8b"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18670.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea libopeho tse nts'o tse peli holima sebopeho sa lehe. Libopeho tse nts'o tse peli, ke litsebe tsa Ntja, hape o toroea sebilikoe se sets'o kahara sebopeho sa lehe. Sebilikoe se sets'o ke nko ea Ntja, hape o toroea mola ka holima nko.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6345f8c60aafef11f63c8ffe39f26843b47dc3ff0d08f08af8c346081ea05981"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18671.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea mahlo le lints'i tsa Ntja. Mahlo ke matheba a mabeli. Lints'i ke mela e 'meli. Helee se setle haholo!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a2ddc40e06a7d78b416b4a0e15422aef52dabecf0f429dacbb45d94a517401f7"
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18672.png",
      "text": "Joale o toroea molomo oa Ntja. Molomo ke mola. Sebopeho seo ke tlhaku ea 'w' hape, ebe o toroea matheba a mang ho pota-pota le molomo oa Ntja. A mararo lehlakoreng le lets'ehali, le a mararo lehlakoreng le letona.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=13",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a46e1b3daeade2382a128e5b3e1e120bf602c8d5c72648a90dc24ca102054ff3"
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18673.png",
      "text": "Sets'oants'o se sentse se tlo fela. O toroea matsoho le maoto a Ntja. Matsoho le maoto ke mela, hape o toroea monoana oa leoto oa Ntja. Menoana ea maoto ke libilikoe, hape o toroea mohatla oa Ntja. Mohatla o shebehala joalo ka palesa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=14",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f26a4e4de5aca747225888fe9f1c77a42c2f70b664e896367e5e56467fa81f69"
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18674.png",
      "text": "Qetellong o toroea libilikoe tse nts'o 'meleng oa Ntja, hape o kenya 'mala o mosehla 'meleng oa eona. Joale sets'oants'o se felile. Helee, botle bo hlollang!.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=15",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:f2c97d11870a02576dcee763f0b2147b15be4b602e476a4b437ffa3cb73aaf5b"
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/18675.png",
      "text": "Sala hantle Katse. Sala hantle sets'oants'o sa Katse. Sala hantle Ntja. Sala hantle sets'oants'o sa Ntja.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36339#page=16",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:704d88cd4dc9c1ac3eaa192af3c640f43065c82e07d4c3ab8f294eb335fa58e5"
    },
    {
